{"id":111460,"date":"2026-03-02T14:04:04","date_gmt":"2026-03-02T07:04:04","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/?p=111460"},"modified":"2026-05-22T14:46:57","modified_gmt":"2026-05-22T07:46:57","slug":"nalu-pelo-mundo-explora-o-vietna-com-a-mundo-asia-tours-cultura-experiencias-exclusivas-e-cenarios-de-tirar-o-folego","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/pt\/nalu-pelo-mundo-explora-o-vietna-com-a-mundo-asia-tours-cultura-experiencias-exclusivas-e-cenarios-de-tirar-o-folego\/","title":{"rendered":"Nalu Pelo Mundo explora o Vietn\u00e3 com a Mundo Asia Tours: cultura, experi\u00eancias exclusivas e cen\u00e1rios de tirar o f\u00f4lego"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">A influenciadora <\/span><b>Nalu Pelo Mundo<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> embarcou em uma jornada especial pelo Vietn\u00e3 com um roteiro inteiramente organizado pela <\/span><b>Mundo Asia Tours<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, ag\u00eancia especializada em viagens personalizadas e experi\u00eancias culturais aut\u00eanticas pelo Sudeste Asi\u00e1tico.<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/>\n<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Ao longo da viagem, Nalu explorou <\/span><b>Han\u00f3i<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> e a deslumbrante <\/span><b>Ba\u00eda de Halong<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, vivendo momentos \u00fanicos que refletem a ess\u00eancia vibrante e acolhedora do pa\u00eds.<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-111716 \" src=\"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/NaluPorMundo-1.jpg\" alt=\"NaluPorMundo\" width=\"702\" height=\"439\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/NaluPorMundo-1.jpg 800w, https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/NaluPorMundo-1-300x188.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-conten