bft do Viagem, Aventura e Fami\u0301lia (@nalupelomundo) chia s\u1ebb<\/a><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/blockquote>\n<p><script async src=\"\/\/www.instagram.com\/embed.js\"><\/script><\/p>\n<h3><span class=\"ez-toc-section\" id=\"Jeep_Food_Tour_%E2%80%94_Descobrindo_sabores_a_ceu_aberto\"><\/span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><b>Jeep Food Tour \u2014 Descobrindo sabores a c\u00e9u aberto<\/b><\/span><span class=\"ez-toc-section-end\"><\/span><\/h3>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-111462 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/jeep-tour.jpg\" alt=\"jeep tour\" width=\"700\" height=\"459\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/jeep-tour.jpg 700w, https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/jeep-tour-300x197.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/jeep-tour-150x98.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px\" \/><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400; font-size: 12pt;\">Um passeio divertido pelas ruas de Han\u00f3i a bordo de um Jeep militar, combinando gastronomia local com a energia da cidade. Nalu experimentou pratos t\u00edpicos e o famoso c\u00e0 ph\u00ea tr\u1ee9ng (egg coffee), uma das bebidas mais tradicionais do Vietn\u00e3.\u00a0<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400; font-size: 12pt;\">Foi uma forma aut\u00eantica e descontra\u00edda de sentir o verdadeiro esp\u00edrito gastron\u00f4mico da capital.<\/span><\/p>\n<h3><span class=\"ez-toc-section\" id=\"Flower_Experience_%E2%80%94_Arte_delicadeza_e_cultura\"><\/span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><b>Flower Experience \u2014 Arte, delicadeza e cultura<\/b><\/span><span class=\"ez-toc-section-end\"><\/span><\/h3>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-111463 \" src=\"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/Isso-e-Vietna-\ud83c\uddfb\ud83c\uddf3-Nosso-primeiro-dia-na-capital-Hanoi-foi-demais-Bem-que-vcs-nos-disseram-q-225x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"388\" height=\"517\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/Isso-e-Vietna-\ud83c\uddfb\ud83c\uddf3-Nosso-primeiro-dia-na-capital-Hanoi-foi-demais-Bem-que-vcs-nos-disseram-q-225x300.jpg 225w, https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/Isso-e-Vietna-\ud83c\uddfb\ud83c\uddf3-Nosso-primeiro-dia-na-capital-Hanoi-foi-demais-Bem-que-vcs-nos-disseram-q-768x1024.jpg 768w, https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/Isso-e-Vietna-\ud83c\uddfb\ud83c\uddf3-Nosso-primeiro-dia-na-capital-Hanoi-foi-demais-Bem-que-vcs-nos-disseram-q-640x853.jpg 640w, https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/Isso-e-Vietna-\ud83c\uddfb\ud83c\uddf3-Nosso-primeiro-dia-na-capital-Hanoi-foi-demais-Bem-que-vcs-nos-disseram-q-150x200.jpg 150w, https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/Isso-e-Vietna-\ud83c\uddfb\ud83c\uddf3-Nosso-primeiro-dia-na-capital-Hanoi-foi-demais-Bem-que-vcs-nos-disseram-q.jpg 1080w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 388px) 100vw, 388px\" \/>\u00a0<img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-111464 \" src=\"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/Screenshot-2026-02-23-114407-172x300.png\" alt=\"Nula por mundo \" width=\"297\" height=\"518\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/Screenshot-2026-02-23-114407-172x300.png 172w, https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/Screenshot-2026-02-23-114407-150x262.png 150w, https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/Screenshot-2026-02-23-114407.png 524w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 297px) 100vw, 297px\" \/><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Outro momento marcante foi a <\/span><b>Flower Experience<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, uma atividade cultural que explora o significado das flores na est\u00e9tica vietnamita. <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Nalu p\u00f4de criar seus pr\u00f3prios arranjos florais, aprender t\u00e9cnicas tradicionais e registrar fotos encantadoras em cen\u00e1rios cuidadosamente decorados. <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Uma experi\u00eancia leve, art\u00edstica e cheia de sensibilidade.<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<h3><span class=\"ez-toc-section\" id=\"Train_Street_%E2%80%94_Fotos_iconicas_e_atmosfera_local\"><\/span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><b>Train Street \u2014 Fotos ic\u00f4nicas e atmosfera local<\/b><\/span><span class=\"ez-toc-section-end\"><\/span><\/h3>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-111465\" src=\"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/nalu-por-mundo.jpg\" alt=\"nalu por mundo\" width=\"683\" height=\"683\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/nalu-por-mundo.jpg 1080w, https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/nalu-por-mundo-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/nalu-por-mundo-1024x1024.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/nalu-por-mundo-150x150.jpg 150w, https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/nalu-por-mundo-768x768.jpg 768w, https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/nalu-por-mundo-96x96.jpg 96w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 683px) 100vw, 683px\" \/><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400; font-size: 12pt;\">Na famosa Rua do Trem, Nalu tirou fotos ic\u00f4nicas, visitou caf\u00e9s charmosos e aproveitou a atmosfera \u00fanica desse ponto t\u00e3o tradicional da cidade.<\/span><\/p>\n<blockquote class=\"instagram-media\" style=\"background: #FFF; border: 0; border-radius: 3px; box-shadow: 0 0 1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.5),0 1px 10px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.15); margin: 1px; max-width: 540px; min-width: 326px; padding: 0; width: calc(100% - 2px);\" data-instgrm-permalink=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/reel\/DUdJm52D6Wq\/?utm